2:Tfa7,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/seedance-2-5#article","headline":"Seedance 2.5 is live on Melius: 30-second video with audio","description":"Seedance 2.5 is live on Melius. ByteDance's new video model generates up to 30 seconds in a single take with audio in the same pass, and takes up to 50 reference files. Here is what shipped, what you can run today, and what is still coming.","url":"https://www.melius.com/blog/seedance-2-5","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/seedance-2-5"},"datePublished":"2026-08-07","dateModified":"2026-08-07","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Melius Team","url":"https://www.melius.com"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#organization"},"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#website"},"inLanguage":"en-US","image":"https://www.melius.com/images/blog/seedance-2-5-launch/cover.webp","timeRequired":"PT5M","wordCount":453,"articleSection":"Melius News","keywords":"Melius News"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Blog","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Seedance 2.5 is live on Melius: 30-second video with audio","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog/seedance-2-5"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Seedance 2.5 out?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. ByteDance released Seedance 2.5 and it is live in the Melius video model picker. You can run it in text-to-video, image-to-video, reference-to-video, and video-to-video, with generated audio in the same pass."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long can a Seedance 2.5 video be?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Up to 30 seconds in a single generation. Melius exposes every whole-second length from 4 to 30 seconds, so you set the shot length rather than stitching a 5-second loop into something longer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What resolution does Seedance 2.5 support on Melius?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"480p, 720p and 1080p, with 720p as the default. You can generate a 1080p take directly on Melius and keep it with its references and previous versions on the canvas."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Seedance 2.5 generate audio?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Audio is produced together with the video rather than dubbed on afterwards, so footsteps, speech, and ambience line up with what is on screen. There is a sound toggle on the node if you want a silent clip."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many reference inputs does Seedance 2.5 take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Up to 30 reference images, 10 reference videos, and 10 audio clips, capped at 50 files in total across all three. That is what lets you hold a character, a product, or a house style steady across a 30-second shot."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the difference between Seedance 2.5 and Seedance 2.0?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Seedance 2.5 doubles the maximum clip length from 15 to 30 seconds, raises the reference ceiling to 50 files across images, video, and audio, and adds video-to-video with reference conditioning. Seedance 2.0 stays in the picker and is still the cheaper, faster option for short shots."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does Seedance 2.5 cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It runs on the same shared Melius credit pool as every other image, video, and audio model, priced per second of output, with 480p costing roughly half of 720p. There is no separate Seedance subscription to buy, so you can compare it against Kling, Veo, and Sora on the same budget."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What aspect ratios does Seedance 2.5 support?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"21:9, 16:9, 4:3, 1:1, 3:4, and 9:16. The vertical ratios matter most in practice, since a large share of the video work on Melius is cut for social."}}]}]}7:X
