18:["$","ul","b307-parent",{"children":[["$","li","b307",{"children":[["$","strong","b305",{"children":["30 seconds in one take. "]}],"Double Seedance 2.0's ceiling, and long enough to be a finished shot rather than a loop you have to extend. Melius exposes every length from 4 to 30 seconds."]}],["$","li","b310",{"children":[["$","strong","b308",{"children":["Up to 50 reference files. "]}],"Thirty images, ten videos, and ten audio clips, capped at 50 in total. This is the feature that holds a character or a product on-model across a long shot."]}],["$","li","b313",{"children":[["$","strong","b311",{"children":["Video-to-video with references. "]}],"Feed in existing footage plus reference images and a prompt, and restyle or re-shoot it rather than starting from a blank frame."]}]]}]
