1d:["$","ol","b382-parent",{"children":[["$","li","b382",{"children":[["$","strong","b377",{"children":["Start from a frame you already like. "]}],"Image-to-video outruns text-to-video by better than two to one in our data, because a validated still removes half the uncertainty. Which means the ",["$","$L14","b380",{"link":{"_type":"link","_key":"b379","href":"/blog/nano-banana-image-models","isNewTab":false},"children":["image model you generate that still with"]}]," decides a lot about the clip."]}],["$","li","b385",{"children":[["$","strong","b383",{"children":["Use the reference budget. "]}],"If you rationed reference frames to fit older limits, stop. Fifty files is room for a character sheet, a product from several angles, a style board, and a voice sample all at once."]}],["$","li","b391",{"children":[["$","strong","b386",{"children":["Compare it against the field. "]}],"Because Melius puts ",["$","$L14","b389",{"link":{"_type":"link","_key":"b388","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false},"children":["every model under one subscription"]}]," and one credit pool, running the same shot through Seedance 2.5, Kling, and Veo side by side costs you nothing extra in setup."]}]]}]
