21:["$","div","b403",{"className":"faq-list my-10 flex flex-col divide-y divide-black/10 border-y border-black/10","children":[["$","details","0",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Is Seedance 2.5 out?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Yes. ByteDance released Seedance 2.5 and it is live in the Melius video model picker. You can run it in text-to-video, image-to-video, reference-to-video, and video-to-video, with generated audio in the same pass."}]]}],["$","details","1",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How long can a Seedance 2.5 video be?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Up to 30 seconds in a single generation. Melius exposes every whole-second length from 4 to 30 seconds, so you set the shot length rather than stitching a 5-second loop into something longer."}]]}],["$","details","2",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["What resolution does Seedance 2.5 support on Melius?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"480p, 720p and 1080p, with 720p as the default. You can generate a 1080p take directly on Melius and keep it with its references and previous versions on the canvas."}]]}],["$","details","3",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Does Seedance 2.5 generate audio?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Yes. Audio is produced together with the video rather than dubbed on afterwards, so footsteps, speech, and ambience line up with what is on screen. There is a sound toggle on the node if you want a silent clip."}]]}],["$","details","4",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How many reference inputs does Seedance 2.5 take?","$L2e"]}],"$L2f"]}],"$L30","$L31","$L32"]}]
22:["$","section","related",{"className":"relative w-full pb-section bg-gray-background","children":[["$","$L11",null,{"color":"gray"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-300 px-5 lg:px-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h-2 mb-12 text-center text-balance text-gray-dark-1","children":"Related Articles"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto grid w-full max-w-max grid-cols-1 gap-11 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","$L33","post-aigc-marketing-content",{"post":{"_key":"post-aigc-marketing-content","slug":"aigc-marketing-content","category":"guides","title":"AIGC for marketing: scaling AI-generated visual content","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"8 Min Read","excerpt":"What is AIGC? AI-generated content is reshaping how marketing teams produce images and video at scale. Here is a plain-English guide to generative AI in content workflows, how Google views AI content, and how a single canvas like Melius turns one brief into on-brand visuals across every model.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/aigc-marketing-content/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"What is AIGC?","answer":"AIGC stands for AI-generated content: the text, images, audio, and video that generative AI drafts, generates, and edits, rather than a person producing every asset by hand. In marketing it means using AI to scale creative production without scaling headcount. On Melius, AIGC is visual, you describe a shot and generate on-brand images and video across every major model on one canvas."},{"question":"Which AI can generate the best multimedia content?","answer":"There is no single best model, only the one that fits the job in front of you. Different models win at product photography, cinematic video, text inside an image, or fast iteration, so the strongest setup lets you switch between them. Melius routes across every major image, video, and audio model on the same canvas, so you pick per job instead of betting on one provider."},{"question":"What are the best generative AI tools for content creation?","answer":"The best tool depends on the work, but for visual marketing content the strongest option aggregates many models, adds an agent that can plan multi-step jobs, and keeps collaboration and assets in one place. Melius does all three: every frontier model under one subscription, an agent named Mel that builds and runs the pipeline, and a real-time multiplayer canvas where the whole team works."},{"question":"How do you automate content creation with AI?","answer":"Set up repeatable steps so a brief triggers generation instead of manual work at every stage. On Melius you teach the agent your brand once as reusable skills and templates, then Mel plans the steps, picks a model per step, and runs the pipeline, so producing a campaign's worth of visuals becomes a request rather than a day of clicking."},{"question":"How do marketing teams use generative AI without losing brand voice?","answer":"Teach the tool your brand once instead of re-explaining it every time. Feed it your guidelines, palette, and reference images so every generation stays on-brand. Melius stores that context plus saved slash-command skills, so the agent applies your look to each image and video automatically rather than drifting from one generation to the next."},{"question":"Is AI-generated content good for SEO?","answer":"Yes, when it is genuinely useful. Google rewards high-quality content however it is produced and judges it on E-E-A-T (experience, expertise, authoritativeness, trustworthiness), so AIGC that answers the query and reads naturally can rank. Effort is better spent raising quality than trying to evade AI-content detection."},{"question":"How do you balance AI and human creativity in content creation?","answer":"Let AI carry the labor of execution and keep the labor of taste human. Generative AI clears blank-page syndrome and the slow, mechanical parts of production, while strategy, emotional resonance, and final judgment stay with people. Melius is built around that split, so the platform handles generation and editing while you steer the creative direction."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"generative-ai-the-engine-behind-aigc","title":"Generative AI"},{"_key":"from-blank-page-to-finished-brief-the-aigc-workflow","title":"The Workflow"},{"_key":"generative-ai-vs-human-creatives-finding-the-balance","title":"Human + AI"},{"_key":"how-google-views-ai-generated-content","title":"SEO"},{"_key":"choosing-an-aigc-platform","title":"Choosing a Platform"},{"_key":"getting-more-out-of-aigc","title":"Actionable Tips"},{"_key":"the-future-of-marketing-is-collaborative","title":"The Future"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1530","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1525","text":"The buzzword echoing through every marketing team today is AIGC. But ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1526","text":"what is AIGC","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1527","text":"? It stands for artificial-intelligence-generated content, the text, images, audio, and video that ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1528","text":"generative AI","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1529","text":" now drafts, generates, and edits instead of a person producing every asset by hand. It is a genuine shift in how digital media is conceived, created, and published.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1539","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1536","href":"https://www.melius.com/","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1531","text":"Welcome to ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1532","text":"AI content marketing","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1533","text":". Gone are the days when growing a brand meant manually producing every social post, ad, and campaign visual. Today savvy teams lean on ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1534","text":"automated content","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1535","text":" to scale reach without burning out a creative team, and on the visual side a single canvas like ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1537","text":"Melius","marks":["b1536"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1538","text":" turns one brief into on-brand images and video across every major model.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1541","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1540","text":"Generative AI: the engine behind AIGC","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"generative-ai-the-engine-behind-aigc"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1545","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1542","text":"At the heart of this shift is generative AI. Unlike traditional software that only analyzes data, generative artificial intelligence creates net-new material from what it has learned. That capability is what produced the explosion in ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1543","text":"AI-generated content","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1544","text":", letting teams of any size compete on a global scale.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1547","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1546","text":"Content automation is no longer a futuristic idea, it is a daily reality. Brands set up pipelines where a brief triggers generation, so the work stays active around the clock without exhausting the people behind it. Rather than betting on one model, Melius routes across every major image, video, and audio model, so each asset is made by the model that suits it best, all on one canvas.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1549","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1548","text":"From blank page to finished brief: the AIGC workflow","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"from-blank-page-to-finished-brief-the-aigc-workflow"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1551","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1550","text":"The biggest hurdle in content production is the blank page. AIGC removes it. Instead of grinding through preliminary sketches and mood boards, you can generate dozens of on-brief directions in seconds, then spend your energy refining the ones worth keeping.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1553","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1552","text":"To get real leverage, though, you can't treat AI as an afterthought bolted onto the end. It works best embedded at every stage of the content lifecycle:","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1556","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1554","text":"Research & plan: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1555","text":"use AI to turn a brief into concrete directions, references, and a shot list.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1559","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1557","text":"Generate: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1558","text":"produce the first round of images and video, picking the right model per shot.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1562","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1560","text":"Edit & finish: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1561","text":"reframe, resize, remove backgrounds, and caption without leaving the canvas.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1565","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1563","text":"Distribute: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1564","text":"export every aspect ratio each channel needs from the same source.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1572","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1569","href":"/blog/brief-to-execution-workflow","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1566","text":"When those stages live in one place, ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1567","text":"scaling content production with generative AI","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1568","text":" stops being a scramble across five tools. That is the same brief-to-finished-asset loop we cover in ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1570","text":"from brief to execution","marks":["b1569"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1571","text":", and on Melius the agent Mel can carry the whole sequence, wiring and running the steps so you move from one campaign a week to five without losing brand consistency.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1574","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1573","text":"Generative AI vs human creatives: finding the balance","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"generative-ai-vs-human-creatives-finding-the-balance"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1576","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1575","text":"As AIGC spreads, one debate keeps surfacing: will AI replace content marketers and creatives? The short answer is no. AI is astonishing at generating options at speed, but it lacks empathy, cultural nuance, and lived experience. The winning strategy is not replacement, it is collaboration.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1578","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1577","text":"Treat AI as a fast, capable junior on the team. To keep your identity intact, teach it your brand once, your guidelines, palette, and reference images, so it produces work that already looks like you. On Melius you store that brand context and save reusable slash-command skills, so every generation stays on-brand instead of drifting. The human then steps in as editor and strategist, injecting emotion, checking facts, and making sure the work resonates.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1580","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1579","text":"How Google views AI-generated content","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"how-google-views-ai-generated-content"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1582","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1581","text":"Every SEO lead is asking the same thing: how does Google rank AI-generated content? Historically search engines penalized auto-generated spam. But Google has clarified that it rewards high-quality content however it is produced, focusing on E-E-A-T, experience, expertise, authoritativeness, and trustworthiness. If your AIGC provides genuine value, answers the query, and reads naturally, it can rank.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1586","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1583","text":"So rather than spending energy on avoiding AI-content detection, put it into raising quality. Modern algorithms read the intent behind a search, not just the keywords, so your content has to answer the ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1584","text":"why","marks":["em"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1585","text":" behind a query and cover related subtopics thoroughly to build topical authority. The same applies to the visuals: original, on-brand imagery holds attention on the page better than generic stock.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1588","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1587","text":"Choosing an AIGC platform","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"choosing-an-aigc-platform"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1590","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1589","text":"With hundreds of tools flooding the market, picking one can feel overwhelming, and enterprise needs differ sharply from a solo creator's. When you evaluate an AIGC platform for visual content, look past the demo reel for a few things that decide whether it scales with you:","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1593","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1591","text":"Model coverage: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1592","text":"the best output comes from routing to the right model per job, so a platform that aggregates many beats one locked to a single provider.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1596","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1594","text":"Collaboration: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1595","text":"real-time multiplayer keeps generating, editing, and approvals on the work itself instead of scattered across email and chat.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1599","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1597","text":"An agent that executes: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1598","text":"an assistant that plans and runs multi-step jobs, not one that answers a single prompt at a time.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1602","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1600","text":"Transparent pricing: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1601","text":"one subscription with a shared credit pool beats stacking a separate plan for every model.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1607","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1604","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1603","text":"Melius is built to those four. Every frontier image, video, and audio model shares ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1605","text":"one subscription","marks":["b1604"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1606","text":", the canvas is real-time multiplayer, and the agent Mel builds and runs the pipeline for you. The table shows how the usual fragmented stack collapses onto one platform.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b1608","rows":[{"_key":"b1609","cells":[{"_key":"b1610","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1612","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1611","text":"Job to be done","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1613","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1615","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1614","text":"The fragmented stack","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1616","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1618","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1617","text":"On Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1619","cells":[{"_key":"b1620","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1622","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1621","text":"Generate images & video","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1623","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1625","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1624","text":"A subscription per model","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1626","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1628","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1627","text":"Every major model, one subscription","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1629","cells":[{"_key":"b1630","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1632","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1631","text":"Keep a look on-brand","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1633","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1635","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1634","text":"Re-upload references each time","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1636","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1638","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1637","text":"Brand taught once as reusable skills","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1639","cells":[{"_key":"b1640","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1642","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1641","text":"Edit, resize, caption","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1643","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1645","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1644","text":"Round-trip through separate apps","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1646","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1648","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1647","text":"Built into the canvas","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1649","cells":[{"_key":"b1650","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1652","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1651","text":"Collaborate & approve","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1653","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1655","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1654","text":"Files emailed back and forth","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1656","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1658","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1657","text":"Real-time multiplayer on the canvas","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1659","cells":[{"_key":"b1660","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1662","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1661","text":"Automate repeat work","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1663","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1665","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1664","text":"Manual, step by step","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1666","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1668","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1667","text":"Mel plans and runs the pipeline","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1670","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1669","text":"Getting more out of AIGC","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"getting-more-out-of-aigc"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1672","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1671","text":"To get the most from these tools, you need a structured approach rather than one-off prompting. Three habits do most of the work.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1674","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1673","text":"1. Master the prompt","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1680","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1675","text":"An AI is only as good as the instructions you give it. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1676","text":"\"Make an ad\"","marks":["em"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1677","text":" yields something generic. A strong visual prompt names the subject, composition, lighting, camera, and mood, for example ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1678","text":"\"a top-down flat-lay of a matte-black skincare bottle on wet slate, soft window light from the left, shallow depth of field, editorial beauty style.\"","marks":["em"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1679","text":" On Melius you can go further and hand Mel the brief, and it translates intent into a wired, multi-step pipeline.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1682","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1681","text":"2. Personalize at scale","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1684","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1683","text":"Mass marketing is out, hyper-personalization is in. AIGC lets you spin one concept into many, a different cut for each channel, audience, or test. Magic resize reframes a single design into every aspect ratio you need for social, web, and print in one pass, so tailoring to each surface costs minutes, not a re-shoot.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1686","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1685","text":"3. Track content ROI","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1688","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1687","text":"The point of adopting these tools is improving ROI through automation. Track the hours your team saves on drafting and production, then reallocate them to high-impact work like strategy, distribution, and community. Lower the cost of production while raising output and quality, and the return compounds.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1690","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1689","text":"The future of marketing is collaborative","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"the-future-of-marketing-is-collaborative"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1692","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1691","text":"The rise of AIGC is not a passing trend, it is the new foundation of digital communication. The brands that dominate feeds and search results will be the ones that adopt it deliberately: deploying generative tools, teaching them a consistent brand, and prioritizing genuine value over gaming the algorithm.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1700","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1694","href":"/blog/modern-creative-workflow-tools","isNewTab":false},{"_type":"link","_key":"b1697","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1693","text":"AI will not replace human creativity, it amplifies it. For a wider look at the tools around it, see ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1695","text":"the modern creative workflow","marks":["b1694"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1696","text":". Then bring generation, editing, assets, and collaboration onto one canvas. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1698","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b1697"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1699","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1702","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1701","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b1703","items":"$22:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:post:faq"}]}}],"$L34","$L35"]}]]}]]}]
