2e:["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]
2f:["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Up to 30 reference images, 10 reference videos, and 10 audio clips, capped at 50 files in total across all three. That is what lets you hold a character, a product, or a house style steady across a 30-second shot."}]
30:["$","details","5",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["What is the difference between Seedance 2.5 and Seedance 2.0?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"Seedance 2.5 doubles the maximum clip length from 15 to 30 seconds, raises the reference ceiling to 50 files across images, video, and audio, and adds video-to-video with reference conditioning. Seedance 2.0 stays in the picker and is still the cheaper, faster option for short shots."}]]}]
31:["$","details","6",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How much does Seedance 2.5 cost?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"It runs on the same shared Melius credit pool as every other image, video, and audio model, priced per second of output, with 480p costing roughly half of 720p. There is no separate Seedance subscription to buy, so you can compare it against Kling, Veo, and Sora on the same budget."}]]}]
32:["$","details","7",{"className":"faq-item","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-gray-dark-1 flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 font-medium select-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["What aspect ratios does Seedance 2.5 support?",["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","aria-hidden":"true","className":"text-foreground-muted size-5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 [[open]_&]:rotate-180","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M6 9l6 6 6-6","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round"}]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-b-1 text-foreground-muted m-0 pr-8 pb-5","children":"21:9, 16:9, 4:3, 1:1, 3:4, and 9:16. The vertical ratios matter most in practice, since a large share of the video work on Melius is cut for social."}]]}]
34:["$","$L33","post-modern-creative-workflow",{"post":{"_key":"post-modern-creative-workflow","slug":"modern-creative-workflow-tools","category":"guides","title":"The modern creative workflow: every tool you need, in one place","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"8 Min Read","excerpt":"The modern creative stack has sprawled into a dozen subscriptions, stock sites, and disconnected apps. Here is a guide to the tools, assets, and platforms behind a fast creative workflow, and how a single canvas like Melius collapses generation, editing, assets, and collaboration into one place.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/modern-creative-workflow/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"How do I choose the right creative tools for my projects?","answer":"Start from the jobs, not the brand names. You need a way to generate and edit visuals, a source of high-quality assets (photos, vectors, video, fonts), somewhere to organize everything, and a way to collaborate, then pick the fewest tools that cover all four. The common mistake is buying a separate subscription for each job. A platform like Melius folds generation, editing, asset management, and real-time collaboration onto one infinite canvas, so most of the stack collapses into a single tool."},{"question":"Can AI replace human creativity?","answer":"No. AI generators clear away blank-page syndrome and the slow, mechanical parts of production, but taste, strategy, and emotional resonance stay human. Melius is built around that split: the platform handles the labor of execution so you keep the labor of taste."},{"question":"What are the best AI tools for graphic design?","answer":"There is no single best tool or model, only the one that fits the job in front of you. Different models win at product photography, cinematic frames, text in images, or fast iteration, so the strongest setup is one that lets you switch between them. That is why Melius routes across every major image, video, and audio model instead of betting on one, so you can pick per job on the same canvas."},{"question":"How do I manage my digital assets?","answer":"Use clear naming conventions, separate raw assets from working files and final exports, and lean on a Digital Asset Management (DAM) system so nothing gets lost. In Melius every generation, upload, and export lands in a searchable team asset library automatically, so organization happens as a byproduct of working rather than a separate chore."},{"question":"How do DAM tools support creative teams?","answer":"A DAM keeps a team's images, video, fonts, and files tagged, versioned, and findable, so people spend time creating instead of hunting for the latest file. Melius goes further by putting that shared library on the same real-time, multiplayer canvas where the work is made, so generating, editing, commenting, and asset reuse all happen in one place."},{"question":"What is an AI design agent for creative workflows?","answer":"It is an assistant that plans and carries out multi-step creative work, generating options, wiring them together, and editing, rather than answering one prompt at a time. In Melius the work lives on a shared canvas, and teams can connect their own external AI agents to it over MCP so an assistant reads and acts on the same live document."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"navigating-the-new-era-of-digital-creativity","title":"New Era"},{"_key":"essential-design-software-and-creative-platforms","title":"Software"},{"_key":"where-to-find-design-inspiration","title":"Inspiration"},{"_key":"the-visual-building-blocks-photography-vectors-and-video","title":"Assets"},{"_key":"teamwork-and-asset-management-behind-the-scenes","title":"Teamwork"},{"_key":"conclusion","title":"Conclusion"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1310","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1307","text":"In today's fast-paced digital landscape, bringing a creative vision to life takes more than raw talent. It takes the right arsenal of tools. Whether you are a solo freelancer, a marketing agency, or part of an in-house design team, the ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1308","text":"creative resources","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1309","text":" you reach for can be the difference between an average project and an unforgettable one.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1315","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1312","href":"https://www.melius.com/","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1311","text":"The intersection of artificial intelligence and traditional design has opened up an entirely new way to brainstorm, execute, and deliver. This guide walks through the tools, assets, and platforms behind a fast, modern creative workflow, and where a single platform like ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1313","text":"Melius","marks":["b1312"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1314","text":" replaces most of the stack by pulling generation, editing, assets, and collaboration onto one infinite canvas.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1317","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1316","text":"Navigating the new era of digital creativity","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"navigating-the-new-era-of-digital-creativity"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1324","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1321","href":"/blog/aigc-marketing-content","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1318","text":"The creative process used to rely entirely on manual effort, often stalled by creative blocks and tedious preliminary sketching. Today's landscape is heavily supported by smart technology. We now have advanced ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1319","text":"idea generators","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1320","text":" that can jump-start a session from a single text prompt, part of the wider shift to ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1322","text":"AI-generated content (AIGC)","marks":["b1321"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1323","text":" that is reshaping marketing.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1332","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1325","text":"These ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1326","text":"imagination tools","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1327","text":", AI image generators and intelligent copy assistants, don't replace human ingenuity. They clear away blank-page syndrome. By rapidly generating mood boards or concept variations, they let you spend your energy on refinement, strategy, and emotional resonance. This is exactly the split Melius is built around: an infinite canvas where a prompt becomes a first draft in seconds, so the empty artboard is never where a project dies. The platform handles the ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1328","text":"labor of execution","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1329","text":" so you keep the ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1330","text":"labor of taste","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1331","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1334","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1333","text":"Essential design software and creative platforms","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"essential-design-software-and-creative-platforms"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1338","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1335","text":"At the core of any visual project is the software you build it in. Industry standards are well known, but there is a fast-expanding ecosystem of ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1336","text":"creative platforms","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1337","text":" for every skill level, budget, and hardware setup.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1340","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1339","text":"Breaking the subscription model","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1346","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1341","text":"If you want to cut overhead without sacrificing professional capabilities, there are phenomenal ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1342","text":"Adobe Creative Cloud alternatives","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1343","text":". Affinity Designer, Affinity Photo, and DaVinci Resolve deliver studio-grade tools without recurring monthly fees. For community-driven software, ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1344","text":"open source design tools","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1345","text":" like GIMP, Inkscape, and Blender offer powerful, cost-free environments for photo work, vectors, and 3D.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1353","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1350","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1347","text":"The subscription trap shows up worst in AI. A separate $20 plan for images, another for video, another for voice, another for copy, and the ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1348","text":"AI tax","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1349","text":" quietly clears $100 a month. Melius takes the opposite approach: one subscription that routes across every major image, video, and audio model. Instead of paying five vendors and switching between five tabs, you pick the model per job on one canvas. That is the same argument we make in ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1351","text":"one subscription, every model","marks":["b1350"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1352","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1355","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1354","text":"Tools for new creators","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1359","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1356","text":"Just starting out? The barrier to entry has never been lower. There is fantastic ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1357","text":"digital illustration software for beginners","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1358","text":", like Procreate on iPad or Krita on desktop, with intuitive interfaces and natural brush dynamics that make digital painting feel as organic as traditional media. Melius meets beginners from the other direction, no brush skills required. You describe what you want in plain language, and generate, reframe, or restyle it directly on the canvas.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1361","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1360","text":"Harnessing specialized artistic applications","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1367","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1362","text":"Beyond general-purpose ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1363","text":"design software","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1364","text":", specialized ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1365","text":"artistic applications","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1366","text":" are making waves. AI upscalers restore low-resolution photos, and neural filters turn snapshots into stylized paintings in seconds. Melius bundles a growing set of these production tools into the same canvas, so you never leave to finish a job:","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1370","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1368","text":"Magic resize ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1369","text":"reframes a single design into every aspect ratio you need for social, web, and print in one pass.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1373","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1371","text":"Background removal ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1372","text":"cleans up images and video without a round trip to another app.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1376","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1374","text":"Video stitching and subtitles ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1375","text":"assemble clips, add captions, and export finished cuts on the same surface where you generated them.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1378","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1377","text":"Where to find design inspiration","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"where-to-find-design-inspiration"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1382","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1379","text":"Even experienced designers hit a wall. Knowing ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1380","text":"where to find design inspiration","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1381","text":" is a real skill. Behance, Dribbble, and Awwwards are great starting points, but look beyond traditional portfolios too.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1385","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1383","text":"Curate a swipe file: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1384","text":"save great typography, clever color, and strong layouts in one place.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1388","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1386","text":"Explore outside your niche: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1387","text":"if you design websites, study interior design or architecture for structure.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1393","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1389","text":"Deconstruct the masters: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1390","text":"don't just admire a design, break down ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1391","text":"why","marks":["em"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1392","text":" the font and negative space work.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1396","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1394","text":"Actionable tip: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1395","text":"spend 15 minutes each morning browsing a new source and bookmarking what catches your eye. In Melius, inspiration turns into a starting point instead of a dead end, the template gallery lets you drop a proven, on-brand workflow onto your canvas and remix it into your own, so you begin from momentum rather than a blank page.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1398","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1397","text":"The visual building blocks: photography, vectors, and video","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"the-visual-building-blocks-photography-vectors-and-video"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1402","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1399","text":"No project is complete without high-quality assets. For web design, editorial, and content marketing, the ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1400","text":"best free stock photo sites","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1401","text":", Unsplash, Pexels, and Pixabay, offer authentic photography that avoids the staged look of early-2000s stock.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1408","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1403","text":"For graphic design and scalable UI, a reliable source of ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1404","text":"royalty free vector graphics","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1405","text":" like Freepik, Vecteezy, or SVG Repo gives you icons and illustrations that resize and recolor without losing a pixel. And for video, ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1406","text":"high resolution video footage","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1407","text":" no longer needs a production budget, Coverr, Mixkit, and Videezy offer 4K and HD clips for backgrounds and reels.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1410","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1409","text":"The catch with stock is that it never quite matches the brief. Melius closes that gap by generating exactly the shot you need, in the exact ratio and style, then keeping every result, upload, and export in one searchable team asset library so your building blocks are always on hand.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1412","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1411","text":"Understanding usage rights","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1416","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1413","text":"When you use third-party assets, legal compliance is non-negotiable. Consult a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1414","text":"creative commons licensing guide","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1415","text":" before putting downloaded media into commercial work. Know the difference between CC0 (public domain, no attribution) and CC BY (attribution required) so an unexpected copyright claim never lands on you or your client.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1418","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1417","text":"Teamwork and asset management: behind the scenes","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"teamwork-and-asset-management-behind-the-scenes"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1422","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1419","text":"Making the work is only half the battle. Managing it and collaborating on it matters just as much, especially as remote and hybrid work become the norm. Teams lean on ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1420","text":"collaborative tools for remote teams","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1421","text":" like Miro, FigJam, or Milanote, infinite whiteboards for brainstorming and review.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1427","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1424","href":"/blog/connect-ai-agents-canvas-mcp","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1423","text":"Melius brings that collaboration into the place where the work actually gets made. The canvas is multiplayer and real-time: designers, copywriters, and stakeholders can generate, edit, comment, and sign off together in the same document, so feedback happens on the work rather than in a separate thread. Teams that want to go further can even ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1425","text":"connect external AI agents to the canvas over MCP","marks":["b1424"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1426","text":", and let an assistant read and act on the same live document.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1431","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1428","text":"As your library of fonts, vectors, photos, and project files grows, digital chaos follows. Knowing ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1429","text":"how to organize digital assets","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1430","text":" is a creative superpower:","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1436","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1432","text":"Establish naming conventions: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1433","text":"use clear, descriptive names (e.g. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1434","text":"ClientName_Website_Homepage_v2","marks":["em"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1435","text":").","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1439","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1437","text":"Use folder hierarchies: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1438","text":"keep raw assets, working files, and final exports separate.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1442","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1440","text":"Invest in management tools: ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1441","text":"a dedicated Digital Asset Management system like Eagle or Bynder lets you tag, categorize, and preview so time goes to creating, not digging.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1444","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1443","text":"In Melius this is built in. Every generation, upload, and export lands in a searchable team asset library automatically, organization becomes a byproduct of working, not a separate job. The table below shows how the fragmented stack collapses onto one platform.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b1445","rows":[{"_key":"b1446","cells":[{"_key":"b1447","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1449","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1448","text":"Job to be done","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1450","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1452","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1451","text":"The fragmented stack","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b1453","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1455","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1454","text":"On Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1456","cells":[{"_key":"b1457","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1459","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1458","text":"Generate images & video","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1460","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1462","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1461","text":"A separate subscription per model","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1463","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1465","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1464","text":"Every major model, one subscription","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1466","cells":[{"_key":"b1467","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1469","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1468","text":"Edit, resize, remove backgrounds","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1470","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1472","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1471","text":"Hop between specialized apps","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1473","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1475","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1474","text":"Built into the canvas","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1476","cells":[{"_key":"b1477","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1479","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1478","text":"Source assets","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1480","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1482","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1481","text":"Stock sites + license admin","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1483","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1485","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1484","text":"Generate to brief, kept in the library","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1486","cells":[{"_key":"b1487","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1489","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1488","text":"Organize files","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1490","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1492","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1491","text":"A standalone DAM system","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1493","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1495","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1494","text":"Auto-organized team asset library","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b1496","cells":[{"_key":"b1497","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1499","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1498","text":"Collaborate & review","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1500","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1502","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1501","text":"Whiteboard + chat, separate from the work","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b1503","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b1505","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1504","text":"Real-time multiplayer on the canvas","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1507","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1506","text":"Conclusion","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"conclusion"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1509","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1508","text":"We are living in a golden age of creation, where the gap between a great idea and its execution is thinner than ever. By blending traditional software, cutting-edge AI, and a wealth of visual assets, you can scale your output without sacrificing quality.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1511","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1510","text":"The key is to stay curious, organized, and adaptable, and to stop paying the tax of a scattered toolchain. When generation, editing, assets, and collaboration live on one canvas, the possibilities for what you can build, design, and inspire are truly endless.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1516","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1513","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1512","text":"Want to bring your whole creative workflow onto a single canvas? ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1514","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b1513"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1515","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1521","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b1518","href":"/blog/video-asset-management","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1517","text":"For the next step, see ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1519","text":"organizing and sharing video assets","marks":["b1518"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b1520","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b1523","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b1522","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b1524","items":"$34:props:post:faq"}]}}]
35:["$","$L33","post-higgsfield-alternative",{"post":{"_key":"post-higgsfield-alternative","slug":"higgsfield-alternative","category":"comparisons","title":"The best Higgsfield alternative for cinematic AI video","isoDate":"2026-07-21","date":"July 21, 2026","readTime":"6 Min Read","excerpt":"Looking for a Higgsfield alternative? Higgsfield nails cinematic camera motion, but teams outgrow its fixed roster and export-to-edit workflow. Here's an honest look at how Melius handles the same work, with every frontier model, an agent that plans multi-step pipelines, and a place to finish the cut.","image":{"url":"/images/blog/higgsfield-alternative/cover.webp"},"authors":[{"name":"Alex Chen, Member of Technical Staff"}],"faq":[{"question":"What is the best Higgsfield alternative?","answer":"For teams that want more than cinematic camera presets, Melius is the strongest alternative. It routes across every frontier video and image model (Kling, Veo, Sora, Seedance, Nano Banana Pro and more), adds Mel, an agent that plans and wires multi-step work on a shared canvas, supports real-time multiplayer, and keeps every model under one subscription with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage instead of a fixed roster."},{"question":"Does Melius do cinematic camera motion like Higgsfield?","answer":"Melius routes to the same frontier video models that produce cinematic motion, so you describe the shot and Mel writes the per-model prompt each one responds to. Higgsfield's preset virtual camera rig is a genuine specialty, and if that exact preset-driven motion control is your entire workflow it is very good at it. The trade is model breadth and an in-app place to assemble the finished cut."},{"question":"Why do people look for a Higgsfield alternative?","answer":"The most commonly reported reasons are workflow friction: unlimited-mode jobs getting queued behind paid ones, and no in-app editing timeline, so clips get exported to Premiere, DaVinci or CapCut to assemble. Teams also outgrow a fixed model roster and want an agent that plans and runs multi-step work rather than a separate chat surface."},{"question":"Can I assemble a finished video in Melius?","answer":"Yes. Melius has an in-app multi-track editor, so you can generate shots, arrange them, layer audio and export from one place rather than exporting individual clips to a separate editor."},{"question":"Is Melius model-agnostic?","answer":"Yes. Melius runs every major image, video and audio model side by side and lets you pick the right one per shot. Its MCP server is canvas-level, so an external agent like Claude can build and run the canvas itself, not just request a single generation, which is a step beyond a generation-only integration."}],"tableOfContents":[{"_key":"what-higgsfield-does-well","title":"The specialty"},{"_key":"where-teams-hit-friction","title":"The friction"},{"_key":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work","title":"The Melius approach"},{"_key":"who-should-switch","title":"Who should switch"},{"_key":"frequently-asked-questions","title":"FAQ"}],"content":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b792","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b791","text":"Higgsfield earned its following with one thing done unusually well: cinematic camera motion. Its virtual camera rig, motion presets, and VFX library make it fast to turn a still into a crash-zoom, an orbit, or a stylized ad clip, and its Marketing Studio can spin a product URL into a finished spot. If that preset-driven look is the whole job, it is genuinely good at it.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b796","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b793","text":"But a lot of teams outgrow a tool built around one specialty. If you are searching for a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b794","text":"Higgsfield alternative","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b795","text":", it is usually because you want the same frontier model quality without the roster limits or the export-and-assemble-elsewhere workflow, and with an agent that runs the whole pipeline. Here is an honest look at where Higgsfield shines, where teams hit friction, and how Melius approaches the same work.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b798","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b797","text":"What Higgsfield does well","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"what-higgsfield-does-well"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b800","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b799","text":"Credit where it is due. Higgsfield's camera-motion control is best-in-class, its Soul model keeps a character identity consistent across shots, and its preset and VFX library make polished social output quick. It has also expanded well beyond a single generate box, adding a node-based canvas, team collaboration, and an MCP server. For fast, cinematic ad creative, it is a capable tool.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b802","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b801","text":"Where teams hit friction","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"where-teams-hit-friction"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b804","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b803","text":"The recurring complaints are less about output and more about how the product is metered and where the workflow ends.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b807","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b805","text":"\"Unlimited\" that queues. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b806","text":"Users report that unlimited-mode jobs get throttled into a queue while credit-metered jobs run instantly.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b810","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b808","text":"No place to finish the cut. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b809","text":"There is no in-app editing timeline, so you export clips and assemble them in Premiere, DaVinci or CapCut.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b812","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b811","text":"How Melius approaches the same work","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"how-melius-approaches-the-same-work"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b814","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b813","text":"Melius is a creative workspace built around model choice and orchestration rather than one signature effect. You generate on a node-based canvas where every prompt, image, video clip and audio track is a connected node, and the output of one flows into the next.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b820","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b817","href":"/blog/one-subscription-every-model","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b815","text":"Every model, one credit pool. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b816","text":"Kling, Veo, Sora and Seedance for video; Nano Banana Pro, GPT Image and Seedream for images; ElevenLabs and Seed Audio for sound. You pick the right one per shot instead of being limited to a fixed roster, and ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b818","text":"every model draws from a single subscription","marks":["b817"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b819","text":" with up to 8 seats on self-serve plans, unlimited seats on Enterprise, and unlimited agent usage.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b826","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b823","href":"/blog/brief-to-execution-workflow","isNewTab":false}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b821","text":"An agent that operates the canvas. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b822","text":"Mel doesn't just generate next to your work. It reads the canvas, picks a model for each step, wires the nodes together and runs them, so a brief like \"product shot, then a five-second cinematic clip\" becomes a ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b824","text":"real brief-to-execution pipeline","marks":["b823"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b825","text":". Higgsfield's autonomous agent works as a separate chat surface that triggers its studios, rather than building and running the node graph itself.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b829","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b827","text":"Works where briefs land. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b828","text":"The same agent runs inside Slack, so someone can request a spot, review it, and download the finished cut in a thread. Most tools at best post outputs to Slack while the real work stays in their app.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b832","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b830","text":"A workforce, not one bot. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b831","text":"Run several agents at once, each claiming a visible region of the canvas so teammates can see who is working on what, with real-time multiplayer for the humans too.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b835","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b833","text":"Find every shot you've already made. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b834","text":"Every generation and upload is auto-indexed into a semantic asset library, so you pull back a past shot by describing what's in it instead of digging through folders, the kind of memory a preset-driven generator doesn't keep for you.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"b838","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b836","text":"Drive it from your own tools, finish in one place. ","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b837","text":"The Melius MCP is canvas-level: an external agent like Claude can build and run the canvas itself, not just call a generation endpoint. And an in-app multi-track editor means you assemble the finished cut without leaving for Premiere or CapCut.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"portableTable","_key":"b839","rows":[{"_key":"b840","cells":[{"_key":"b841","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b843","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b842","text":"","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b844","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b846","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b845","text":"Melius","marks":["strong"]}]}]},{"_key":"b847","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b849","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b848","text":"Higgsfield","marks":["strong"]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b850","cells":[{"_key":"b851","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b853","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b852","text":"Core focus","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b854","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b856","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b855","text":"Agent-run creative workspace","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b857","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b859","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b858","text":"Cinematic video & ad creative","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b860","cells":[{"_key":"b861","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b863","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b862","text":"Model access","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b864","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b866","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b865","text":"Every major image, video & audio model","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b867","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b869","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b868","text":"Curated roster + proprietary models","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b870","cells":[{"_key":"b871","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b873","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b872","text":"Agent operates the canvas","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b874","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b876","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b875","text":"Builds & runs the nodes","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b877","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b879","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b878","text":"Separate chat agent","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b880","cells":[{"_key":"b881","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b883","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b882","text":"Agent in Slack","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b884","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b886","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b885","text":"Full workflow in a thread","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b887","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b889","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b888","text":"Posts outputs only","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b890","cells":[{"_key":"b891","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b893","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b892","text":"Multiple agents at once","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b894","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b896","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b895","text":"Yes, with visible presence","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b897","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b899","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b898","text":"One at a time","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b900","cells":[{"_key":"b901","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b903","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b902","text":"Canvas-level MCP","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b904","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b906","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b905","text":"Builds & runs the canvas","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b907","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b909","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b908","text":"Generation-only","marks":[]}]}]}]},{"_key":"b910","cells":[{"_key":"b911","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b913","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b912","text":"Camera / motion control","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b914","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b916","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b915","text":"Prompt-driven","marks":[]}]}]},{"_key":"b917","text":[{"_type":"block","_key":"b919","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b918","text":"Dedicated controls (a real strength)","marks":[]}]}]}]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b921","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b920","text":"Who should switch","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"who-should-switch"},{"_type":"block","_key":"b923","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b922","text":"If Higgsfield's camera rig and character models are the entire reason you're there, they are hard to beat on those axes. But if the bottleneck is throughput, turning briefs into finished, on-brand creative, then an agent that actually operates the canvas, works in Slack, runs many-at-once with visible presence, and is drivable from your own AI tools matters more than any single model knob. That is what Melius is built for.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b928","style":"normal","markDefs":[{"_type":"link","_key":"b925","href":"https://app.melius.com","isNewTab":true}],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b924","text":"See how your own shots break down across models. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b926","text":"Open Melius","marks":["b925"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"b927","text":".","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"b930","style":"h2","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"b929","text":"Frequently asked questions","marks":[]}],"anchorId":"frequently-asked-questions"},{"_type":"faqList","_key":"b931","items":"$35:props:post:faq"}]}}]
